	(text "My plan is to remove the dupont housing from the motor, \nwhile keeping the crimped ends in place.\nI will then secure the motor wires to the screw terminals \non the driver (maybe via some crimped termination) and \nrefit the encoder cables to a 4 slot dupont that will \nhave a 3D-printed attachment to secure it.\n\nI am also interested in buying snapfit sockets and \nterminations. We will just need to see what works best."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 145.034 30.988 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "79393bfd-6c57-4b3e-98cb-471159d3d2b9")
	)
